	.string "\ncome all the way"
	.string "\phere? Good! I will"
	.string "\nreward your hard"
	.string "\pwork by battling"
	.string "\nwith all of my"
	.string "\lstrength!$"

Unova_VictoryRoadCave1F_Text_VeteranFVictoryRoadCave1FSeenText::
